  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows valproate sodium injection from Fresenius Kabi and Hikma as Current since 2020-12-30; Sagent Pharmaceuticals is not on the list and its label names no plant we could place",
  "headline_cites": ["E30", "E31", "E32", "D7"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the valproate sodium injection shortage on 2020-12-30 and updated it on 2026-10-15, noting the next release for Fresenius Kabi is November 2026 and to check wholesalers for inventory.",
      "cites": ["E32"]
    },
    {
      "text": "As of 2026-10-21 the shortage has been on FDA's list for 70 months.",
      "cites": ["D10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fresenius Kabi's plant (FEI 3001833549) received an OAI classification letter on 2017-12-28, 1098 days before the shortage posting, and later inspections returned to VAI.",
      "cites": ["D6", "E18", "E21", "E26", "E27"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Hikma's plant (FEI 3002807173) received an OAI classification on 2014-03-28 and a Warning Letter on 2014-10-21, with the most recent inspection VAI on 2023-04-21.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E14", "E13"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sagent Pharmaceuticals is not on FDA's shortage list today and its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "P&T-approved interchange options exist for Hikma 500 mg/5 mL (approved 2025-12-04) and Fresenius Kabi 100 mg/mL (approved 2026-04-19), both requiring pharmacist verification.",
      "cites": ["E33", "E34"]
    }
  ]
}
